{
  "id": "bigville_econloop",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville production-economy R5 (block 304000): the CLOSED self-balancing loop, composing resource supply + emergent price (R3) + labour mobility (R4). Each extraction trade has a Deposit (stock/growback) and a Job. Per tick: ec_extract takes supply=min(stock, n_workers*yield) and regrows the deposit; ec_price adjusts the good's market price from supply-vs-demand (glut lowers, scarcity raises); ec_wage sets wage = price*yield; ec_switch moves a worker to the best-paying trade net of role_identity friction. The negative feedback closes: scarce good -> high price -> high wage -> labour IN -> more supply -> price DOWN -> labour OUT -> equilibrium at supply ~ demand. Untuned; stability is what falls out.",
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": [],
  "productions": [],
  "concepts": [],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "ec_extract",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Once per epoch: supply = min(stock, n_workers*yield); the deposit regrows by growback minus what was taken, clamped to [0,capacity]. n_workers = Count of works_as into the job.",
      "match": [["job", "harvests", "dep"], ["job", "in_town", "town"]],
      "where": {"type": "Lt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "ec_epoch"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "town"}, "key": "epoch"}},
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "job", "n_workers", {"__term__": {"type": "Count", "source": {"type": "InNeighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "edge_type": "works_as"}}}],
        ["set_attr", "job", "supply", {"__term__": {"type": "Min", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"},
          {"type": "Times", "items": [
            {"type": "Count", "source": {"type": "InNeighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "edge_type": "works_as"}},
            {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "yield"}
          ]}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "dep", "stock", {"__term__": {"type": "Max", "items": [
          {"type": "Lit", "value": 0.0},
          {"type": "Min", "items": [
            {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "capacity"},
            {"type": "Minus", "a": {"type": "Plus", "items": [
              {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"},
              {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "growback"}
            ]}, "b": {"type": "Min", "items": [
              {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"},
              {"type": "Times", "items": [
                {"type": "Count", "source": {"type": "InNeighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "edge_type": "works_as"}},
                {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "yield"}
              ]}
            ]}}
          ]}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "job", "ec_epoch", {"__term__": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "town"}, "key": "epoch"}}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ec_price_glut",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Supply outran demand this tick -> the good's market price FALLS by price_step (floored at min_price). Fires after ec_extract set supply (fixpoint re-derives on the supply write).",
      "match": [["job", "harvests", "dep"]],
      "where": {"type": "And", "items": [
        {"type": "Gt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "supply"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "demand"}},
        {"type": "Gt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "price"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "min_price"}},
        {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "priced_epoch"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 0.0}}
      ]},
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "job", "price", {"__term__": {"type": "Max", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "min_price"},
          {"type": "Minus", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "price"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "price_step"}}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "job", "priced_epoch", 1.0]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ec_price_scarce",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Supply fell short of demand -> the good's market price RISES by price_step. Scarcity raises the price (and thus the wage), pulling labour in.",
      "match": [["job", "harvests", "dep"]],
      "where": {"type": "And", "items": [
        {"type": "Lt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "supply"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "demand"}},
        {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "priced_epoch"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 0.0}}
      ]},
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "job", "price", {"__term__": {"type": "Plus", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "price"},
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "price_step"}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "job", "priced_epoch", 1.0]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ec_wage",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "wage = price*yield - crowd*n_workers. The price term is the SLOW (across-tick) market signal; the crowd term is the FAST (within-tick) congestion signal that stops a herd: as workers pile into a trade during one tick, its wage falls immediately, so the next worker's turn sees a lower wage and stops piling. n_workers is recomputed fresh each run (Count of works_as). Without the crowd term the whole mobile pool flips to the same 'best' trade every tick and OSCILLATES.",
      "match": [["job", "harvests", "dep"]],
      "where": {"type": "Lit", "value": true},
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "job", "n_workers", {"__term__": {"type": "Count", "source": {"type": "InNeighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "edge_type": "works_as"}}}],
        ["set_attr", "job", "wage", {"__term__": {"type": "Minus", "a": {"type": "Times", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "price"},
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "yield"}
        ]}, "b": {"type": "Times", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "key": "crowd"},
          {"type": "Count", "source": {"type": "InNeighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "job"}, "edge_type": "works_as"}}
        ]}}}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ec_switch",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "R4 labour mobility: a worker (whose turn it is, can_switch=1) moves to the BEST-paying trade iff best_wage-current > role_identity*friction_scale. Owners (high role_identity) stay; labourers (low) move. Closes the loop back onto supply.",
      "match": [
        ["w", "works_as", "curjob"],
        ["w", "in_town", "town"],
        ["town", "has_job", "altjob"]
      ],
      "where": {"type": "And", "items": [
        {"type": "Not", "arg": {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Var", "name": "altjob"}, "b": {"type": "Var", "name": "curjob"}}},
        {"type": "Gt",
          "a": {"type": "Minus", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "altjob"}, "key": "wage"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "curjob"}, "key": "wage"}},
          "b": {"type": "Times", "items": [
            {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "w"}, "key": "role_identity"},
            {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "town"}, "key": "friction_scale"}
          ]}},
        {"type": "Not", "arg": {"type": "Exists",
          "source": {"type": "Neighbours", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "town"}, "edge_type": "has_job"},
          "var_name": "j2",
          "predicate": {"type": "Gt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "j2"}, "key": "wage"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "altjob"}, "key": "wage"}}}},
        {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "w"}, "key": "can_switch"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 1.0}}
      ]},
      "effects": [
        ["del_edge", "w", "works_as", "curjob"],
        ["add_edge", "w", "works_as", "altjob"],
        ["set_attr", "w", "role", {"__term__": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "altjob"}, "key": "trade"}}]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
